@baseUrl = http://localhost:5263
@processId = 1
@workerId = CustomerCsvWorker
@executionId = 36

### 1. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Listar ejecuciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/executions
Accept: application/json

### 3. Iniciar ejecución
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/executions/start
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "processId": {{processId}},
  "workerId": "{{workerId}}"
}

### IMPORTANTE
### Copiar el executionId devuelto arriba
### y reemplazar el valor de @executionId.

### 4. Finalizar ejecución exitosamente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/executions/{{executionId}}/finish
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "Succeeded",
  "errorMessage": null,
  "totalItems": 10,
  "succeededItems": 10,
  "failedItems": 0,
  "affectedRows": 10
}

### 5. Consultar detalle
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/executions/{{executionId}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Consultar ejecuciones trabadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/executions/stuck?olderThanMinutes=30
Accept: application/json
